program	errors/infer_underdetermined.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot infer type argument `T` for function `make`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot infer type argument `T` for function `make`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/infer_underdetermined.saw:10:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 |     let x = make()"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: give the type argument(s) explicitly, e.g. `make<T=...>`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
